Z||000004||85Josh||04-30-2001||12:26 PM||||DO IT! There, God spoke again! The Duke is a great engine for real-world driving. I just followed 007 Doug's new Formula from Toney, AL to Bowling Green, KY over some huge hills. I had no trouble maintaining 75-80, and the drive was a blast! It all comes down to what you like.<P>------------------<BR>85 2M4(Lil' Bit)||||reg||14
